# A tiny road map. Edit the numbers, add edges, then run:
#   python3 implementation.py routes.graph
#
# Format:  SOURCE TARGET WEIGHT [both]
#   "both" makes the road two-way. Leave it off for a one-way street.

Home  Cafe    4  both
Home  Park    2  both
Park  Cafe    1  both
Cafe  Office  5  both
Park  Office  8  both

# Queries run top to bottom:
from Home
path Home Office
